flowchart LR
  subgraph ABC[ABC owns simulator and physical task]
    Assets[Original fixed five-bottle scene]
    Host[Root: original ABC host\nCPU MuJoCo physics and MJWarp cameras]
    Limits[Physical action limits\nNormalized action boundary]
    Judge[Original instantaneous success judge\nTermination and timeout]
    Assets -->|data: native assets| Host
    Limits -->|control: 14 physical commands| Host
    Host -->|data: physical state and result| Judge
  end
  subgraph Sadhana[Sadhana owns training and evaluation]
    CLI[FastTD3 agent: bounded CLI\nNew isolated Python 3.10 prefix]
    RPC[Explicit Unix RPC\nPrivileged qpos, qvel, scene metadata]
    Author[Original FastTD3\nMLP actor and distributional critics]
    Replay[Original GPU replay and normalization]
    Export[Original checkpoint export\nNo exact resume claim]
    Eval[Root: separate frozen evaluation\nExplicit matched seeds]
    Receipt[Update counts, finite samples\nState fingerprints and receipts]
    CLI -->|control: resolved original arguments| Author
    Author -->|control: normalized 14D action| RPC
    RPC -->|data: state and true terminal observation| Replay
    Replay -->|data: original sampled batches| Author
    Author -->|data: model and normalizers| Export
    Export -->|data: fixed policy| Eval
    Author -->|data: read-only measurements| Receipt
    Eval -->|data: task evidence| Receipt
  end
  RPC -->|control: task-owned requests| Limits
  Host -->|data: privileged observation| RPC
  Eval -->|control: held-out reset and action| RPC
  Judge -->|data: success and complete episode| RPC
  Receipt --> Viewer[Root: benchmark viewer and coordination board]
  Peer[Independent agent and OpenQodex\nSource and evidence review] -.->|review: separate from learner| Receipt
